  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "軟體專題製作",
    "sub_ename": "SOFTWARE PROJECT DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之目的在讓學生應用軟體工程原則開發真實世界的軟體解決方案。學生以團隊方式進行專案需求分析、軟體架構設計、功能實作、測試和部署應用程式。課程強調採用標準開發方法論，以及版本控制系統。學生在專案管理、溝通和協作方面獲得實踐經驗，確保團隊有效合作和專案交付。此外，學生還學習軟體專題文件編製、品質保證和維護實踐。通過實際專題，學生發展解決問題的能力、批判性思維能力，並掌握軟體開發工具和技術。課程結束時，學生完成一個全面的軟體專題，展示了他們交付高品質、滿足真實需求的軟體解決方案的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to enable students to apply software engineering principles in developing real-world software solutions. Students collaborate in teams to conduct project requirement analysis, software architecture design, feature implementation, testing, and application deployment. The course emphasizes the adoption of standard development methodologies and version control systems. Students gain practical experience in project management, communication, and collaboration to ensure effective teamwork and project delivery. Additionally, students learn about software project documentation, quality assurance, and maintenance practices. Students develop problem-solving skills, critical thinking abilities, and mastery of software development tools and technologies through practical projects. At the end of the course, students complete a comprehensive software project, demonstrating their ability to deliver high-quality software solutions meeting real-world needs.",
